<dl>
<dt>Source:
<dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
<dt>Sent when:
<dd>an object spawns into the game. This event can fire only once per game for each object, regardless of save games.
<dt>Sent from:
<dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Engine" title="Engine (page does not exist)">engine</a>
<dt>Sent to:
<dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Creature" title="Creature">creatures</a>, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Placeable" title="Placeable">placeables</a>, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Trigger" title="Trigger">triggers</a>, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/AOE" title="AOE">AOEs</a>,
<dt>Parameters:
<dd>
<ul>
<li>Creator: should probably be parent of object spawning (area. module etc')</li>
</ul>
</dl>
